{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地人氣女星趙露思昨日28歲生日，粉絲為她打造以紫色為主題的生日派對，場內有「HAPPY BIRTHDAY」字母拉旗及各式各樣的氣球，還有紫色蛋糕擺設等，儀式感及夢幻氣氛兼備。</p><p>而壽星女的打扮亦充滿少女味，身穿長袖上衣襯蓬蓬裙，當她戴上生日綵</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.384605+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T16:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"ab1093645f070f705c57e95740c27fa8403b5469b102265152a069f6b182cc8b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}